    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "thanks, those are good points. i also need to be ready for when they bring up the environmental side of things. like, they'll probably try to argue that these regs are \"essential for the future\" or something. can you give me a quick summary of the main arguments they usually use so i can prepare a rebuttal? just keep it brief so i can get back to it.",
